        },
        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "G. The Employer agrees to recognize Shop Stewards as designated representatives of the Union.",
            "block_bbox": [
                346,
                231,
                1392,
                264
            ],
            "block_id": 4,
            "block_order": 3,
            "group_id": 4,
            "block_polygon_points": [
                [
                    346.0,
                    231.0
                ],
                [
                    1392.0,
                    231.0
                ],
                [
                    1392.0,
                    264.0
                ],
                [
                    346.0,
                    264.0
                ]
            ]
        },
        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "1. The maximum number of Shop Stewards shall be equal to the number of floors in each Macy's facility covered by the Collective Bargaining Agreement, with one assigned per floor.",
            "block_bbox": [
                347,
                288,
                1481,
                350
            ],
            "block_id": 5,
            "block_order": 4,
            "group_id": 5,
            "block_polygon_points": [
                [
                    347.0,
                    288.0
                ],
                [
                    1481.0,
                    288.0
                ],
                [
                    1481.0,
                    350.0
                ],
                [
                    347.0,
                    350.0
                ]
            ]
        },
        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "2. The Union will notify the Employer in writing of the names of each Shop Steward prior to said Shop Steward assuming his/her duties.",
            "block_bbox": [
                347,
                373,
                1456,
                434
            ],
            "block_id": 6,
            "block_order": 5,
            "group_id": 6,
            "block_polygon_points": [
                [
                    347.0,
                    373.0
                ],
                [
                    1456.0,
                    373.0
                ],
                [
                    1456.0,
                    434.0
                ],
                [
                    347.0,
                    434.0
                ]
            ]
        },
        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "3. The Union agrees to revoke any employee's Shop Steward designation who has been proven to engage in discourteous and/or unprofessional behavior during meetings with management on three separate occasions.",
            "block_bbox": [
                347,
                459,
                1486,
                546
            ],
            "block_id": 7,
            "block_order": 6,
            "group_id": 7,
            "block_polygon_points": [
                [
                    347.0,
                    459.0
                ],
                [
                    1486.0,
                    459.0
                ],
                [
                    1486.0,
                    546.0
                ],
                [
                    347.0,
                    546.0
                ]
            ]
        },
        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "4. Shop Stewards shall have the authority to investigate complaints, intake grievance information, meet with the employer in good faith attempts to resolve grievances, accompany employees during investigatory and/or disciplinary interviews and perform other duties as may be required from time to time by the Union.",
            "block_bbox": [
                346,
                572,
                1486,
                688
            ],
            "block_id": 8,
            "block_order": 7,
            "group_id": 8,
            "block_polygon_points": [
                [
                    346.0,
                    572.0
                ],
                [
                    1486.0,
                    572.0
                ],
                [
                    1486.0,
                    688.0
                ],
                [
                    346.0,
                    688.0
                ]
            ]
        },
        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "5. If a Union representative is not available to attend a meeting between the employer and an employee, where an employee has requested their presence, at the Employer's discretion, a Shop Steward may be requested to attend in the absence of a Union representative. In these instances, a Shop Steward will be paid for the time required to attend. For all other occasions, a Shop Steward's duties shall be performed on the Shop Steward's own time and not on the Employer's time or during prior scheduled hours, except as requested by a designated human resources executive.",
            "block_bbox": [
                347,
                713,
                1444,
                888
            ],
            "block_id": 9,
            "block_order": 8,
            "group_id": 9,
            "block_polygon_points": [
                [
                    347.0,
                    713.0
                ],
                [
                    1444.0,
                    713.0
                ],
                [
                    1444.0,
