        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "H. The parties agree that in the event a Union Representative flagrantly violates the provisions of Section 4 C, D or E the parties will meet and confer in an effort to define and resolve the outstanding violation(s). In the event the parties cannot correct the violation(s) the Employer may submit the violation(s) to the mediation process and the Union agrees to be bound by the decision and remedy of",
